{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T17:31:24.949Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## interface/lte/run-modem-update **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Command":"## interface/lte/run-modem-update \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** Command","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-client **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ppp-client \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-client/scan **Type:** Command":"## interface/ppp-client/scan \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-server **Type:** Directory":"## interface/ppp-server \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/ppp-server/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/ppp-server/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pppoe-client **Type:** Directory":"## interface/pppoe-client \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pppoe-client/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/pppoe-client/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pppoe-client/scan **Type:** Command":"## interface/pppoe-client/scan \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pppoe-server **Type:** Directory":"## interface/pppoe-server \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pppoe-server/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/pppoe-server/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pppoe-server/server **Type:** Directory":"## interface/pppoe-server/server \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## interface/pptp-client/monitor **Type:** Command":"## interface/pptp-client/monitor \n**类型：** 命令","docs-7.25\u0000- Static interfaces are added administratively when you need to reference a specific interface name(for example, in firewall rules or elsewhere) created for a particular user. - Dynamic interfaces are added to this list automatically when a user connects and their username does not match any existing static entry, or if the matching static entry is already active, since two separate tunnel interfaces cannot use the same name.":"- 静态接口由管理员添加，当您需要引用为特定用户创建的接口名称时（例如，在防火墙规则或其他位置），使用静态接口。\n- 当用户连接且其用户名不匹配任何现有静态条目时，或者匹配的静态条目已处于活动状态时，动态接口会自动添加到此列表，因为两个独立的隧道接口不能使用相同名称。","docs-7.25\u0000Dynamic interfaces appear when a user connects and disappear when the user disconnects. Therefore, it is not possible to reference the tunnel created for that user in router configuration(for example, in firewall rules). If persistent rules are required for a user, create a static entry. Otherwise, dynamic configuration is sufficient.":"动态接口在用户连接时出现，并在用户断开连接时消失。因此，无法在路由器配置中引用为该用户创建的隧道（例如，在防火墙规则中）。如果用户需要持久规则，请创建静态条目。否则，动态配置即可满足需求。","docs-7.25\u0000There are two types of interface(tunnel) items in PPPoE server configuration - static users and dynamic connections. An interface is created for each tunnel established to the given server. Static interfaces are added administratively if there is a need to reference the particular interface name(in firewall rules or elsewhere) created for the particular user. Dynamic interfaces are added to this list automatically whenever a user is connected and the user's username does not match any existing static entry(or in case the entry is active already, as there can not be two separate tunnel interfaces referenced by the same name - set the *one-session-per-host* value if this is a problem). Dynamic interfaces appear when a user connects and disappear once the user disconnects, so it is impossible to reference the tunnel created for that user in the router configuration(for example, in firewall), so if you need a persistent rule for that user, create a static entry for him/her. Otherwise, it is safe to use a dynamic configuration.":"PPPoE server 配置中有两类接口（隧道）项 - 静态用户和动态连接。每当与指定服务器建立隧道时，都会创建一个接口。如果需要引用为特定用户创建的特定接口名称（在防火墙规则或其他位置），则以管理方式添加静态接口。每当用户连接且用户名不匹配任何现有静态条目时，动态接口会自动添加到此列表中（或者在该条目已处于活动状态时也会添加，因为不能存在两个同名引用的独立隧道接口 - 如果这会造成问题，请设置 *one-session-per-host* 值）。动态接口在用户连接时出现，并在用户断开连接后消失，因此无法在路由器配置中引用为该用户创建的隧道（例如，在防火墙中）。如果需要针对该用户的持久规则，请为其创建静态条目。否则，使用动态配置是安全的。"}}
